      "color": "orange",
      "text": "Glass. An Apple product page: huge centred type, alternating bands, one frosted-glass panel over a glowing curve.\n\nLayout: Full-width alternating bands, centred; stats in tiles of different spans; one glass stage per page.\nThe memorable thing: The smile chart floating in frosted glass over a soft glow of its own curve.\nType: Albert Sans 700 at 56–86 px with tight tracking for headlines; 500 for subheads; 400 for text.\nLight: bg #FFFFFF, surf #F5F5F7, ink #1D1D1F, muted #6E6E73, acc #0071E3, line #D2D2D7\nDark: bg #000000, surf #161617, ink #F5F5F7, muted #A1A1A6, acc #2997FF, line #333336\nMagnet rail on the right edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
